- 文件：`server/src/{controllers,dtos,services}/photo-copilot*`、`server/src/utils/photo-copilot*` 及注册入口；`web/src/lib/components/asset-viewer/{AssetViewer,AssetViewerNavBar,PhotoCopilotPanel}*`、`web/src/lib/services/photo-copilot.service.ts`；浏览器测试 `e2e/src/ui/specs/asset-viewer/photo-copilot.e2e-spec.ts`；运行说明 `docs/fork-photo-copilot.md` 和容器配置示例 `docker/compose.photo-copilot.example.yml`。
